+    </section>
+  </div>
+
+  <section class="card">
+    <h2>Concept dimensions</h2>
+    <dl class="specs">
+      <div><dt>Front opening, floor to top</dt><dd>45 to 120 cm</dd></div>
+      <div><dt>Cabinet diameter</dt><dd>68 cm</dd></div>
+      <div><dt>Base column diameter</dt><dd>40 cm</dd></div>
+      <div><dt>Panel height</dt><dd>about 70 cm</dd></div>
+      <div><dt>Quarter turn</dt><dd>about 3 s</dd></div>
+    </dl>
+    <p class="note">These numbers are working assumptions for the model, not tested values. The opening sits inside the usual seated forward-reach range (about 38 to 122 cm), and the narrow base leaves open knee space for a wheelchair. Also in the concept but not modelled here: a weight limit per section, removable bins and plug-in power. Check the numbers in the concept test.</p>
+  </section>
+</div>
